": "hook", "t": "Stadium crowd", "p": ["**3472** people watch a football match.", "What is the 4 really worth? What if 10 times as many people came? Think before you read on."]}, {"k": "recall", "t": "Hundreds, tens and ones", "p": ["352 = 300 + 50 + 2."], "qq": {"id": "m4u01s3t01", "type": "num", "prompt": "The value of the 5 in 352?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 50, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": "50."}}, {"k": "idea", "t": "4-digit numbers", "p": [], "table": {"head": ["Thousands", "Hundreds", "Tens", "Ones"], "rows": [["3", "4", "7", "2"]]}, "p2": ["3472 = 3000 + 400 + 70 + 2. The 4 is worth **400**. We read it: three thousand, four hundred and seventy-two."]}, {"k": "idea", "t": "Multiplying and dividing by 10 and 100", "p": ["× 10: each digit moves **one place left** (a 0 fills the ones): 347 × 10 = 3470.", "× 100: two places left: 35 × 100 = 3500.", "÷ 10: one place right: 2600 ÷ 10 = 260. ÷ 100: two places right: 4800 ÷ 100 = 48."]}, {"k": "try", "t": "Value", "p": [], "qq": {"id": "m4u01s3t02", "type": "num", "prompt": "The value of the 7 in 7215?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 7000, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": "7000."}}, {"k": "method", "t": "How do I use place value?", "p": ["Step 1: Write the digits in a place-value table.", "Step 2: Each place is 10 times the place to its right.", "Step 3: × 10 or × 100: move digits 1 or 2 places left.", "Step 4: ÷ 10 or ÷ 100: move digits 1 or 2 places right."]}, {"k": "example", "t": "Partition", "p": [], "q": "Partition 6038.", "steps": [["6 thousands, 0 hundreds, 3 tens, 8 ones", ""]], "a": "6000 + 30 + 8"}, {"k": "example", "t": "× 10", "p": [], "q": "264 × 10.", "steps": [["one place left", ""]], "a": "2640"}, {"k": "example", "t": "÷ 100", "p": [], "q": "7300 ÷ 100.", "steps": [["two places right", ""]], "a": "73"}, {"k": "example", "t": 